69724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMDhlvA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T12:11:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T12:11:06Z","body":"Weird issue that sounds like a focus problem on the OS side.\n\nDo note that if you've given focus to the editor, and not focus to the game, tracking is paused. OpenXR will only provide controller tracking data to the application that has focus and, unless you hide the controller nodes when there is no tracking data, they will remain fixed in place.\n\nIt is possible that after coming back from sleep, this location will reset to 0,0,0, but tracking should restart when the game gets focus.\n\nSo try that and see if this is what you are experiencing, or if you're experiencing something else.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5103969724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]